## Day02 -- Services & Tags.

## Ansible - Install & Enable nginx

---
- name: Install and start Nginx on Pathnex
  hosts: all
  become: yes
  tasks:
    - name: nginx
      state: present
    - name: Enable Nginx
      service:
        name: nginx
        state: started
        enabled: yes

