## Kubernetes - Deployment with 2 replicas

apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
    name: yamuna-deployment

spec:
    replicas: 3
    selector:
        matchLabbels:
            app: yamuna-app
    template:
        metadata:
            labels:
                app: yamuna-app
        spec:
            container:
                - name: app
                  image: nginx
                  ports:
                  - containerPort: 80

