## Maven Build
## Jenkins Pipeline - Maven Build
you will learn how to **Compile, test, and package a Java project** using Maven.

pipeline {
    agent   any
    tools {
        maven 'Maven-3.8.1'
        jdk 'JDK-17'
    }
    stages {
        stage('Checkout') {
            steps {
                git url: 'https://..........'
            }
        }
        stage('Compile') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn clean compile'
            }
        }
        stage('Test') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn test'
            }
        }
        stage('Package') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn package'
            }
        }
    }
}

